{
  "intents": [
    "GENERAL_INFORMATION"
  ],
  "action": "ANSWER_GENERAL_INFORMATION",
  "requires_human_review": false,
  "response_to_therapist": "The CalmTalk therapist onboarding process involves several steps: First, you complete registration on the Provider Portal and submit required documents, including a government-issued photo ID, active professional mental health license, academic credentials, proof of malpractice insurance, updated CV, and banking information for direct deposit. Next, CalmTalk validates your credentials and completes background checks. After that, you'll complete clinical orientation and system training on telehealth privacy standards and platform workflow. Finally, you activate your profile by setting your biography, specialties, availability, and confirming bank details. Your profile appears live on the client directory within about two weeks after submission. If you need further assistance, please let us know."
}

